<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="warranty" xml:lang="zh-CN">
  <title>保修条款</title>
  <shortdesc>产品保修政策概览与保修状态查询方法。完整的保修条款以随附保修卡为准。</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <author type="organization"><keyword keyref="company-name"/></author>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>保修</indexterm>
        <indexterm>售后政策</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname><keyword keyref="product-name"/></prodname>
        <vrmlist><vrm version="1.0"/></vrmlist>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
<section>
      <title>保修范围</title>
    <p conkeyref="shared-brand/warranty-text"/>
    </section>    <section>
      <title>查询保修状态</title>
    <ol>
      <li>在应用中进入 <menucascade><uicontrol>我的设备</uicontrol><uicontrol>设备详情</uicontrol><uicontrol>保修信息</uicontrol></menucascade>。</li>
      <li>或拨打 <keyword keyref="support-phone"/> 提供主机序列号查询。</li>
    </ol>
    </section>    <section>
      <title>不属于保修范围的情形</title>
    <ul>
      <li>超过保修期限。</li>
      <li>使用非原装电源适配器造成的损坏。</li>
      <li>私自拆解、改装或维修。</li>
      <li>不可抗力（雷击、水浸、火灾等）。</li>
      <li>外壳磨损、屏幕划痕等正常损耗。</li>
    </ul>
    <p conkeyref="shared-brand/warranty-extended"/>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
